(6880433, 1036917, 93171, '<td valign="top">I''m not trying to be mean here, but I''m going to give some constructive criticism.  The image quality here is not very great.  It looks like it was cropped from a much larger photo and then oversharpened.  Also, I''m not too keen on the angle of the bird.  My eyes keep going right to the breast/leg area.  I vowed to myself that if I''m giving a lower score, I''m going to give an explanation why- like I said, I''m not trying to be mean.  (In fact, I wish people would give me some constructive criticism instead of just giving me low or meh scores without saying why.)  I hope my comments help you!</td>', 'I''m not trying to be mean here, but I''m going to give some constructive criticism.  The image quality here is not very great.  It looks like it was cropped from a much larger photo and then oversharpened.  Also, I''m not too keen on the angle of the bird.  My eyes keep going right to the breast/leg area.  I vowed to myself that if I''m giving a lower score, I''m going to give an explanation why- like I said, I''m not trying to be mean.  (In fact, I wish people would give me some constructive criticism instead of just giving me low or meh scores without saying why.)  I hope my comments help you!', '2012-10-10 15:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
