(6880458, 1036737, 93171, '<td valign="top">I''m giving you a 6.  I really like the idea of this shot, but I don''t think it was executed quite right.  Panning is HARD.  I don''t know that I''ve ever done a panning shot that I was happy with.  In this shot, the man/jetski are still a little bit blurry.  Still better than what I could''ve done, though!</td>', 'I''m giving you a 6.  I really like the idea of this shot, but I don''t think it was executed quite right.  Panning is HARD.  I don''t know that I''ve ever done a panning shot that I was happy with.  In this shot, the man/jetski are still a little bit blurry.  Still better than what I could''ve done, though!', '2012-10-10 15:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
