(6880894, 1036919, 144365, '<td valign="top">#1.<br/>Without a doubt, my favorite of the challenge. I didn''t get your entry for negative space, but this one is so much better. <br/> <br/>It''s eerie and creepy. Don''t know what the ax is for, but I don''t really care. Like most of these name your FS entry to the extremely loose challenge description, most entries were boring and derivative, this was not. This was a 180 turn from the rest and deserves a 10.</td>', '#1.Without a doubt, my favorite of the challenge. I didn''t get your entry for negative space, but this one is so much better.  It''s eerie and creepy. Don''t know what the ax is for, but I don''t really care. Like most of these name your FS entry to the extremely loose challenge description, most entries were boring and derivative, this was not. This was a 180 turn from the rest and deserves a 10.', '2012-10-11 10:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
