(6884264, 1036556, 12611, '<td valign="top">7. Great composition and super clarity and warm stone colors. (Perhaps too literal for some in that the phrase implies a dispute or conflict- the maddening of one party at a taken offense from another?)</td>', '7. Great composition and super clarity and warm stone colors. (Perhaps too literal for some in that the phrase implies a dispute or conflict- the maddening of one party at a taken offense from another?)', '2012-10-16 11:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
