(6884271, 1036962, 56502, '<td valign="top">Took me a bit to find out what the title is about - but now that I understand it the shot makes much more sense.</td>', 'Took me a bit to find out what the title is about - but now that I understand it the shot makes much more sense.', '2012-10-16 12:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6884276, 1036975, 12611, '<td valign="top">I like the cupcake shirt and the look of the cotton t-shirt, the blur is pleasing as well. (perhaps this is too literal an interpretation of the phrase "nail-biter," which means in the common usage- a tense situation which makes one nervous and anxious. That being said, the shot is not dramatic enough and fails to convey any reason for nail-biting. It almost looks a bit contrived, but it has to be viewed int the spirit of street shots, where the photographer takes lots of shots only to review them later for focus and candid content- in this way, the random "random capture" tagged with that title, works for me, a 7.</td>', 'I like the cupcake shirt and the look of the cotton t-shirt, the blur is pleasing as well. (perhaps this is too literal an interpretation of the phrase "nail-biter," which means in the common usage- a tense situation which makes one nervous and anxious. That being said, the shot is not dramatic enough and fails to convey any reason for nail-biting. It almost looks a bit contrived, but it has to be viewed int the spirit of street shots, where the photographer takes lots of shots only to review them later for focus and candid content- in this way, the random "random capture" tagged with that title, works for me, a 7.', '2012-10-16 12:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6884277, 1036973, 56502, '<td valign="top">Her look is hilarious!</td>', 'Her look is hilarious!', '2012-10-16 12:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
