(6884376, 1036714, 10785, '<td valign="top">Couple issues here technically. The color is a bit off. It''s a little too cool which makes the skin color a little greyish. Compositionally, rule of thirds is good. The model did a nice job conveying the emotion. I get the emotional connection of the person looking away given the title, however there is no connection with the viewer. I would rather see the persons face in profile or otherwise looking out of the frame but still be able to see the eyes.</td>', 'Couple issues here technically. The color is a bit off. It''s a little too cool which makes the skin color a little greyish. Compositionally, rule of thirds is good. The model did a nice job conveying the emotion. I get the emotional connection of the person looking away given the title, however there is no connection with the viewer. I would rather see the persons face in profile or otherwise looking out of the frame but still be able to see the eyes.', '2012-10-16 14:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
